==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 10.67~18.67 seconds<sup>320f~560f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 98% HP:
**2 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**1 [[Zigge]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 78% HP:
**2 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**1 [[Zigge]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Treat this stage like all other Zombie Outbreak stages in Empire of Cats. Regardless of whether you're using zombie killers or not, the Zigges shouldn't pose much of a threat. Spawn any cat you want to defeat the base; the Zigges will burrow under your cats at the enemy base.

